{'symbol': 'LOW', 'date': '2021-11-17 10:00:00', 'title': "LOWE'S ANNOUNCES COMMITMENT TO BECOME THE RETAIL LEADER FOR ONE-STOP AGING-IN-PLACE SOLUTIONS", 'text': "MOORESVILLE, N.C., NOV 17, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0LOWE'S TODAY ANNOUNCED A MULTI-YEAR COMMITMENT TO BECOME THE LEADING RETAIL DESTINATION FOR AGING-IN-PLACE AND LIFE-CHANGE SOLUTIONS THROUGH ITS LAUNCH OF LOWE'S LIVABLE HOME."}{'symbol': 'LOW', 'date': '2021-11-17 06:00:00', 'title': "LOWE'S REPORTS THIRD QUARTER 2021 SALES AND EARNINGS RESULTS", 'text': "MOORESVILLE, N.C., NOV. 17, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- LOWE'S COMPANIES, INC. (NYSE: LOW) TODAY REPORTED NET EARNINGS OF $1.9 BILLION AND DILUTED EARNINGS PER SHARE (EPS) OF $2.73 FOR THE QUARTER ENDED OCTOBER\xa029, 2021 COMPARED TO NET EARNINGS OF $692 MILLION AND DILUTED EPS OF $0.91 IN THE THIRD QUARTER OF 2020."}